    var PaperLink = "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2949882123000142?via%3Dihub";
    var shortDescription = "AI is increasingly finding its way into the world of work and everyday life. Especially in the face of AI anxiety, \n    algorithmic aversion and the risk of being replaced by AI in the workplace, it is important to know your own AI literacy \n    (i.e. competence when using AI) and the AI literacy of (potential) employees. Valid measurement of AI literacy is important for the selection of personnel, \n    identification of shortages in skill and knowledge, and evaluation of AI literacy interventions.\n    A questionnaire was previously missing that is deeply grounded in the existing literature on AI literacy, is modularly applicable depending on the goals, \n    and includes further psychological competencies in addition to the typical facets of AIL.\n    The Meta-Artificial Intelligence Literacy Scale (MAILS) solves this problem: it is a self-assessment questionnaire for the economic assessment of AI literacy. \n    The scale has been developed by a team of researchers from psychology and human-computer interaction. The factorial structure was confirmed, \n    and further efforts are being made to extend the validation of the scale. The scale measures the abilities to Use & apply AI, Understand AI, \n    Detect AI, make ethical considerations in regard to AI (i.e. AI Ethics), Create AI, and AI Self-efficacy in learning \n    and problem-solving and AI Self-management (i.e. AI persuasion literacy and emotion regulation).";
    var germanInstruction = "Im Folgenden lesen Sie Beschreibungen verschiedener F\xE4higkeiten, die man im Umgang mit ku\u0308nstlicher Intelligenz haben kann. Diese F\xE4higkeiten k\xF6nnen st\xE4rker oder schw\xE4cher ausgepr\xE4gt sein. Bitte bewerten Sie sich selbst: Wie stark sind Ihre F\xE4higkeiten ausgepr\xE4gt?\n    Ein Wert von 0 bedeutet, dass eine F\xE4higkeit gar nicht oder kaum ausgepr\xE4gt ist.\n    Ein Wert von 10 bedeutet, dass eine F\xE4higkeit sehr gut oder (nahezu) perfekt ausgepr\xE4gt ist.\n    Bitte kreisen Sie den Wert ein, der Ihre F\xE4higkeit am besten beschreibt.";
